@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra may chu -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach san pham -> 200 OK (3 phan tu ban dau)
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Chi tiet san pham 1 -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. San pham khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Id khong phai so -> 404 rong (Framework)
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao san pham hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createProduct
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 7. Tao san pham gia am -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "",
  "price": -1
}

### 8. Thieu Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/products

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 9. Loc san pham theo tu khoa ?keyword=REST -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/products?keyword=REST

### 10. Ten san pham > 100 ky tu -> 400 Bad Request + ApiError (NAME_TOO_LONG)
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham co ten rat dai vuot qua gioi han mot tram ky tu de kiem tra quy tac nghiep vu NAME_TOO_LONG cua he thong API",
  "description": "Kiem tra gioi han do dai ten",
  "price": 50000
}

### 11. Xoa san pham vua tao o ca 6 -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.id}}

### 12. Xoa san pham khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + ApiError (PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND)
DELETE {{api}}/api/products/999
